  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-rc.2 — release candidate. The .pqfe container format (v2) is FROZEN for 1.x. Adds [Obsolete] (PQFE002) on the inline ML-KEM-768-only recipient mode (PqKeyPair, PqRecipientPublicKey, PqRecipientPrivateKey, recipient overloads on PqFileEncryptor/PqFileDecryptor) — superseded by PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Hybrid; source-compatible (existing callers still build with a deprecation warning). Adds I/O failure-mode test coverage (disk-full mid-write, mid-write cancellation, unwritable destination, max-chunk-size round-trip, truncation at named offsets). EnablePackageValidation against the 1.0.0-rc.1 baseline. No format, public-API, or runtime-dependency changes.",
